# Moltis-Mini Version Tracking
# Format: UPSTREAM_VERSION-mini.NN
# Example: 20260426.01-mini.01
#
# When upstream moltis-org/moltis releases a new version, update UPSTREAM_VERSION.
# When packaging a new mini release based on the same upstream version, increment NN.
# When updating to a new upstream version, reset NN to 01.

20260426.03-mini.01
